              "content": "=You are reviewing a code change from my browser-game project.\n\nCommit:\n{{ $json.commitMessage }}\n\nFile:\n{{ $json.filename }}\n\nChanges:\n+{{ $json.fileAdditions }} additions\n-{{ $json.fileDeletions }} deletions\n\nGit diff:\n{{ $json.patch }}\n\nAnalyze only the code change shown above.\nPay special attention to:\n- values that changed from milliseconds to seconds\n- timers and intervals\n- speed values and their units\n- comparisons between timers and intervals\n- variables renamed during the change\n- calculations where one value may be in milliseconds and another in seconds\n\nDo not assume that a timing conversion is correct just because deltaTimeSeconds is used.\n\nReturn:\n1. A short summary of what changed.\n2. Possible bugs or regressions introduced by this change.\n3. Logic or timing problems.\n4. A suggested improvement, if necessary.\n\nBe concise. If you cannot identify a problem from the provided diff, say so instead of inventing one."
            }
